      "english": "and never, under any circumstances, did he swear an oath by anything or by anybody.",
      "source": "Martyrdom of Victor part 1",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:martyrdoms.victor.budge:1-6",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
